      "message": "Personally, I would prefer to see the GMR_TABLET_MODE_GPIO_L removed and in the tablet mode code use GPIO_TABLET_MODE_L. All of the extraneous GMR_TABLET_MODE_GPIO_L alias defines can then be deprecated away and the few places that a GPIO define is used that is not GPIO_TABLET_MODE_L (such as GPIO_TABLET_MODE, GPIO_LID_360_L, GPIO_SLATE_MODE_INDICATION and GPIO_EC_SLATEMODE_HALLOUT_SNSR_R) they can provide the alias to GPIO_TABLET_MODE_L.",
